{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"OpenLess.OpenLess","latestVersion":"2.0.1","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.6c6f0191.png","priority":1,"sha256":"6c6f0191b5a92c335af75597dda91487a812c0c0474b727775510da9ad124a9f","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"按住快捷键说话，松开即得润色后的文字","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/Open-Less/openless/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"zh-CN","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Hold a key, speak, release — AI-polished text appears at your cursor in any app.","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"OpenLess is a cross-platform (macOS & Windows) voice-input app — a fully open-source alternative to commercial tools like Typeless, Wispr Flow, Lazy, and Superwhisper.\nPut your cursor in any text field — ChatGPT, Claude, Cursor, Notion, an email draft, a chat box — press one global hotkey and talk. OpenLess records, transcribes, polishes the text in the mode you picked, and inserts the result at the cursor. If insertion is blocked it copies to the clipboard, so the words you spoke don't get lost.\nUnlike voice typing tools that just dump a word-for-word transcript, OpenLess's headline mode is AI-prompt mode: you ramble, it adds structure, lists constraints, and produces a context-rich prompt you can paste straight into ChatGPT / Claude / Cursor.","tags":["dictate","dictation","speech-recognition","speech-to-text","transcribe","transcription"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"按住快捷键说话，松开即得润色后的文字","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/Open-Less/openless/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"OpenLess 是一个跨平台（macOS & Windows）语音输入应用，对标 Typeless、Wispr Flow、Lazy、Superwhisper 等商业语音输入工具的 完全开源 替代品。\n把光标放在 ChatGPT、Claude、Cursor、Notion、邮件、聊天框任意输入框里，按一次全局快捷键说话——OpenLess 会录音、转写、按你选的模式润色，把结果直接插入光标位置。插入失败时会自动复制到剪贴板，尽量保证「你说过的话不丢」。\n不像那些只把语音转成「逐字稿」的输入法，OpenLess 的核心模式是 AI prompt 模式：你只管乱讲，它自动补上结构、列出约束、整理出有上下文的 prompt，复制粘贴就能直接喂给 ChatGPT / Claude / Cursor。","name":"OpenLess","packageUrl":"https://github.com/Open-Less/openless","publisher":"openless","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/Open-Less","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/Open-Less/openless/releases/tag/v2.0.1-tauri","tags":["听写","语音识别","语音转文字","转写","转录"]}},"longDescription":"OpenLess 是一个跨平台（macOS & Windows）语音输入应用，对标 Typeless、Wispr Flow、Lazy、Superwhisper 等商业语音输入工具的 完全开源 替代品。\n把光标放在 ChatGPT、Claude、Cursor、Notion、邮件、聊天框任意输入框里，按一次全局快捷键说话——OpenLess 会录音、转写、按你选的模式润色，把结果直接插入光标位置。插入失败时会自动复制到剪贴板，尽量保证「你说过的话不丢」。\n不像那些只把语音转成「逐字稿」的输入法，OpenLess 的核心模式是 AI prompt 模式：你只管乱讲，它自动补上结构、列出约束、整理出有上下文的 prompt，复制粘贴就能直接喂给 ChatGPT / Claude / Cursor。","name":"OpenLess","packageUrl":"https://github.com/Open-Less/openless","publisher":"openless","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/Open-Less","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/Open-Less/openless/releases/tag/v2.0.1-tauri","tags":["听写","语音识别","语音转文字","转写","转录"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/2.0.1/app.json","detailSha256":"e77544d4b37bc279917ef19fb06d8075af5c8c81d8d8efae59550107380f9663","releaseDate":"2026-10-16","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"2.0.1"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.3.18/app.json","detailSha256":"24bb261092df4ee575d1b599c2ea43409210c33308511302eb43b5ecefc8033b","releaseDate":"2026-08-21","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.3.18"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.3.17/app.json","detailSha256":"a971c4e77bd4e12896abf478a128d38002fd1c1c452ccb15d5e89b11235f90de","releaseDate":"2026-08-15","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.3.17"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.3.16/app.json","detailSha256":"a32ff47357352b4906cf24c98ef086da6ac617e3c9fb9999302ef7dbe95b1718","releaseDate":"2026-08-05","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"1.3.16"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/1.3.15/app.json","detailSha256":"bea4a2b5d807c6c232df0cbff2891def3b921d01260a169f2f554a00ca6f1df6","releaseDate":"2026-08-03","releaseDa